  Modifications for LibreYOLO:
  - Flattened upstream's ``network/`` subpackage into ``libreyolo/models/depthpro2/``
    and removed ``huggingface_hub.PyTorchModelHubMixin`` / ``snapshot_download``
    from ``DepthPro2Net`` so the graph is pure PyTorch.
  - Made ``timm`` imports lazy inside ``MultiViewEncoder``, ``eva_qkv_rope``,
    ``FOVHead``, and ``FOVEstimator`` so importing LibreYOLO does not require
    the optional ``libreyolo[depthpro2]`` extra until a Depth Pro 2 model is
    instantiated.
  - Added LibreYOLO ``BaseModel`` integration (``model.py``), checksum-pinned
    checkpoint conversion (``convert.py``), and EXIF/intrinsics helpers
    (``utils.py``).

  All parameter names and module structures match upstream so official
  checkpoints load with ``strict=True`` and produce bit-identical FP32 outputs.

